      "id": "claim_f1c50b80e9c746cf88de1f03764d96a3",
      "statement": "Mutating commands run through dispatch_mutating, which preflights rebase state inside the nested repository and preserves a valid pre-existing rebase rather than clobbering it, returning a distinct protected-rebase status.",
