      "statement": "The nested repository's .gitignore excludes .cache/, session_logs/hooks-errors.log, and settings.local.json, all untracked without deletion by checkpoint (and the first two after every successful reconcile), while session_logs/hooks-bypass.log stays tracked; a .gitattributes gives session_logs/*.log the merge=union driver.",
