      "id": "claim_f6e9159963a844b99a467481fffd5cb3",
      "statement": "Bootstrap refreshes land as bootstrap:-prefixed nested commits made by the installer's sync step, distinct from the session: commits session hooks make, so the nested log separates the two sources of change.",
