    {
      "id": "claim_a815423ad1a149d0a35524d028b07cf5",
      "statement": "The installer dispatches --backup-state to _run_backup_state (and so to backup_sidecar_state), --uninstall to _run_uninstall (and so to uninstall_sidecar), and a sidecar target to install_sidecar before validate_agents_takeover or any other full-install step, so a sidecar install, uninstall, or state backup creates or touches no nested .claude repository, ai-state branch, or state sync; a missing git executable ends the install and uninstall paths with 'git not found on PATH' instead of a traceback.",
