      "statement": "state-sync keeps a byte copy of settings.local.json around every pull and unrelated-history merge and afterwards restores it only when the file is missing or equals the origin/<branch> version git wrote; any other content is kept as a newer write together with the copy and a warning, and a failure to make the copy skips the pull or merge.",
